{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「蛤？妳要跟他一起去買送天羽學姊的禮物？」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4431", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。還是愛理也要一起來？」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1545", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我怎麼可能去……應該說妳腦袋是撞到了嗎？」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4432", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「為什麼？」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1546", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一般來說不會做到那種程度吧？為了男人……」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4433", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，果然嗎？我也在想我是不是做過頭了。」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1547", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要去了，只會讓妳自己難受而已。」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4434", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要，我要去。」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1548", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真固執。居然自己找罪受……」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4435", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～我不覺得難受啊～」", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1549", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那在公園裡抱著貓哭的人是誰呢？」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4436", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還發生過那種事呢。」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1550", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼嗯，已經成為可以笑著說出來的回憶了嗎？」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4437", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這個嘛。一個人想起來的時候或許還是會哭。」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1551", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然這樣……」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4438", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，我果然還是希望喜歡上的人能幸福。」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1552", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4439", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「會想要……為他做點什麼。」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1553", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算妳這麼說，我也不懂。」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4440", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那愛理也談一場戀愛吧？」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1554", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那麼蠢的事，我敬謝不敏。」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4441", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「越是這樣想的人，遇到喜歡的男人時就會變得越黏人喔～」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1555", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不會。」", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4442", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好吧。反正我也對那傢伙以外的男人沒興趣。」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1556", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我決定一輩子單身了～」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1557", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4443", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……但是，好像不是迷信呢。」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4444", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，什麼？」", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1558", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女人戀愛時會變漂亮的傳言。」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4445", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有嗎？」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1559", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也好啦，無所謂。」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4446", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「幹嘛啦，一個人擅自得出結論。」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1560", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是什麼好話所以我就不說了。好了好了，那我也決定單身吧。」", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4447", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過啊……」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1561", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4448", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果出現了能讓愛理喜歡上的男人……」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1562", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那傢伙豈不是世界上最帥最強的男朋友？」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1563", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4449", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「妳是不是被戀愛沖昏腦袋了？怎麼可能有那種男人。」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4450", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這麼肯定啊。」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 215, "voice": "sn1564", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當然肯定。」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4451", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為我絕對不會談戀愛的。」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 214, "voice": "ar4452", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
